; Over a ceiling. A second `(fragment …)` against `:max 1`.
;
; The report lands on the second one — the line to delete — not on the
; enclosing form, and you get exactly one no matter how far over you go:
; the count crosses the ceiling once, and the message names the real total.
;
;   positional_too_many at [render-pipeline fragment]
;   form `render-pipeline` accepts at most 1 `fragment` positional child, found 2
;
; Two repairs, and which is right depends on what you meant: delete the
; extra child, if it was a mistake; or raise `:max` in the manifest, if the
; schema was stricter than the domain.
;
;   sjon validate examples/plugins/head-counts/{plugin,example-too-many}.sjon

(render-pipeline :name two-fragments
  (vertex   :entry vs_main)
  (fragment :entry fs_main)
  (fragment :entry fs_alt))
